     <http://bird-bird_toxicology-ontology-20261002-194249/ontology/vkg-bird_toxicology/Bond/molecule_id> ?molecule_id ;
     <http://bird-bird_toxicology-ontology-20261002-194249/ontology/vkg-bird_toxicology/Bond/bond_type> "-" .
