  ?c a <http://bird-bird_toxicology-ontology-20261002-194249/ontology/vkg-bird_toxicology/Connected> ;
     <http://bird-bird_toxicology-ontology-20261002-194249/ontology/vkg-bird_toxicology/Connected/atom_id> ?a .
